                <pb facs="0590" n="474" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg474"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/1215.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-27T12:00:00-04:49">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 27, 1915—12 noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>From all information available President has escaped from the palace and has
                    taken refuge in French Legation which is next door.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
